{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-13T08:47:59.390Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-CROSS-LIVE-01","attempt":1,"title":"A block trade on the real hardware room: sealed, signed firm orders cross at a public reference price, the larger side fills pro rata, and the cash leg settles exactly on the production contract","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. A buyer whose limit is under the reference price is left out; the smaller sell side fills in full and the buy side pro rata; the outcome shows no limit price; sellers are paid and buyers charged exactly the reference price times their filled units.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM.","Only the middle of a block trade is modelled: no indications of interest or firm-up step, no minimum fill, no time priority, a supplied reference price, and only the cash leg settles.","Charges and payouts are public on NEAR, so filled units can be worked out from the cash and the public reference price."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"16fa8f48d48268213aed8c823782cc697b7f541f638f9ed1f19fec084ed30064","chain_hash":"c697ae56819b1eaa61be08ce9951d4207ddbb347956b50a31308d77e55206600"}
